{"id":"v3","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":5,"of":15,"title":"Making it happen","titleHe":"בִּנְיַן הִפְעִיל","goal":"Recognise hif'il and its causative sense.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"הִפְעִיל usually means causing the action rather than doing it. Its present begins with מַ and has a long i in the middle; its past begins with הִ."},{"type":"binyan","he":"הִפְעִיל","en":"hif'il","note":"Causative — making someone else do or become something.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","inf":"לְהַסְבִּיר","en":"to explain"},"tense":"present","rows":[{"label":"masculine singular","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּיר"},{"label":"feminine singular","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירָה"},{"label":"masculine plural","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירִים"},{"label":"feminine plural","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירוֹת"}]},{"type":"binyan","he":"הִפְעִיל","en":"hif'il","note":"Causative — making someone else do or become something.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","inf":"לְהַסְבִּיר","en":"to explain"},"tense":"past","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"הִסְבַּרְתִּי"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"הִסְבַּרְתָּ"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"הִסְבַּרְתְּ"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"הִסְבִּיר"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"הִסְבִּירָה"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"הִסְבַּרְנוּ"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"הִסְבַּרְתֶּם"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"הִסְבַּרְתֶּן"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"הִסְבִּירוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"The causative link is often visible across binyanim on one root. From ל־ב־ש: לוֹבֵשׁ wears, מַלְבִּישׁ dresses someone else, מִתְלַבֵּשׁ gets dressed."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מַסְבִּיר","en":"explains","translit":"masbir"},{"he":"מַתְחִיל","en":"begins","translit":"matchil"},{"he":"מַרְגִּישׁ","en":"feels","translit":"margish"},{"he":"מַזְמִין","en":"invites, orders","translit":"mazmin"},{"he":"מַכִּיר","en":"knows, is acquainted with","translit":"makir"},{"he":"מַחְלִיט","en":"decides","translit":"machlit"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["while","Hanukkah lamp","year","explains"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מַסְבִּיר","translit":"masbir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["pencil","lie, falsehood","therefore","begins"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מַתְחִיל","translit":"matchil"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["and he said","love","feels","it's possible"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַרְגִּישׁ","translit":"margish"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["but","okay, fine","describes","invites, orders"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מַזְמִין","translit":"mazmin"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["window","idea","knows, is acquainted with","religion"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַכִּיר","translit":"makir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["decides","five (m.)","a little, few","bag"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מַחְלִיט","translit":"machlit"},{"type":"choice","q":"Which binyan is this verb in?","options":["הִתְפַּעֵל","פִּעֵל","הִפְעִיל","פָּעַל"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מִתְלַבֵּשׁ"},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — feminine plural, present","options":["מַסְבִּירָה","מַסְבִּירוֹת","מַסְבִּירִים","מַסְבִּיר"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"הִפְעִיל, present: feminine plural is מַסְבִּירוֹת."},{"type":"read","he":"מַרְגִּישׁ","translit":"margish","en":"feels"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “invites, orders”?","options":["שִׂמְחָה","שָׁמַיִם","מַזְמִין","רָץ"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — masculine singular, present","options":["מַסְבִּיר","מַסְבִּירָה","מַסְבִּירוֹת","מַסְבִּירִים"],"correct":0,"he":true,"why":"הִפְעִיל, present: masculine singular is מַסְבִּיר."},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — masculine plural, present","options":["מַסְבִּיר","מַסְבִּירָה","מַסְבִּירוֹת","מַסְבִּירִים"],"correct":3,"he":true,"why":"הִפְעִיל, present: masculine plural is מַסְבִּירִים."},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “explains”?","options"